## IToolbarComponent

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Contracts`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Components.Core`

### Purpose
Defines a component that renders in the chat toolbar. Extensions use this to add buttons, controls, or other UI elements to the chat interface toolbar.

### Interface Definition

```csharp
public interface IToolbarComponent
{
    Type Component { get; }
    ToolbarAlignment Alignment { get; }
}

public enum ToolbarAlignment
{
    Start, End
}
```

### Properties

| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `Component` | `Type` | The `Type` of the Blazor component to render in the toolbar |
| `Alignment` | `ToolbarAlignment` | Horizontal position: `Start` (left) or `End` (right) |

### Internal Implementation

```csharp
internal class ToolbarComponent : IToolbarComponent
{
    public ToolbarComponent(Type component, ToolbarAlignment alignment)
    {
        Component = component;
        Alignment = alignment;
    }

    public Type Component { get; }
    public ToolbarAlignment Alignment { get; }
}
```

`ToolbarComponent` is the internal implementation. Consumers do not instantiate it directly; use `CyrenaKernelBuilderExtensions.AddToolbarComponent<TComponent>()` instead.

### Registration
Register via `CyrenaKernelBuilderExtensions.AddToolbarComponent<TComponent>()`:
```csharp
builder.AddToolbarComponent<MyToolbarComponent>(ToolbarAlignment.End);
```

This registers the component as a singleton within the kernel scope:
```csharp
builder.Services.AddSingleton<IToolbarComponent>(
    new ToolbarComponent(typeof(TComponent), alignment));
```

### Component Requirements
The component type must extend `KernelComponentBase` (not just `ComponentBase`), as it receives the active `Kernel` instance as a parameter:
```csharp
public class MyToolbarComponent : KernelComponentBase
{
    // Kernel is available as [Parameter]
}
```

### Related
- `KernelComponentBase` - Base class for kernel-aware toolbar components
- `CyrenaKernelBuilderExtensions.AddToolbarComponent<TComponent>()` - Registration method
